  "comments": "Difference between Y#49.1 and Y#49.2.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/56240df97449b.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/56240df97449b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"200\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n© Ulmo<br /><br />\r\nDifferent dies were used.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - the tufts of feathers on the top of eagle&#039;s head in one line, fine script, T far from A to RZECZPOSPOLITA.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - the tufts of feathers on the top of eagle&#039;s head in two lines, bold script, T near A to RZECZPOSPOLITA.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61a600d69fa51.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61a600d69fa51.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"143\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> 1949 - small arcs of rim decoration, fine script, symmetric narrow leaves.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> 1975 - large arcs of rim decoration, bold script, wider leaves, some of them asymmetric.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/61a6014191c8e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/61a6014191c8e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"141\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\nFor compactness only coins without mintmarks are denoted with (kr) and (w). For example &quot;1975&quot; means with mintmark and 1975 (kr) means without mintmark (made in Kremnica, Czechoslovak Socialist Republic), 1957 (w) means without mintmark (made in Warsaw).<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1949.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1957 (w), 1965-1974, 1975, 1977.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1978, 1980, 1980 PS, 1981, 1981 PS.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1975 (kr), 1976 (kr), 1978 (kr), 1982-1985.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1986-1988.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Abbreviation</span><br />\r\nPS - proof set.",
